 <constraint type="min" value="1.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="bcb29bff-87fe-5928-bdf5-415dedd4c7d4" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint type="max" value="3.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="5ff0bd42-bd50-5195-bafc-066a88eeff3b" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints>
 <profiles>
 <profile id="add74915-fb35-543e-9583-5263b1e03259" name="Frigate" hidden="false" typeId="806f9ff1-fd51-5ddb-b005-ce73a5d09d65" typeName="Ship">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="BS" typeId="d130e705-611e-5a0a-bd7d-ea8e848fdb2e">3</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Prow" typeId="84a55377-edbc-5825-a2bf-70c6155018f2">11</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Side" typeId="5f595433-7397-5c4b-9d4a-8f35d83a2b29">10</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Stern" typeId="cd9ec76e-f959-5560-8845-9ab242f16e71">9</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="HP" typeId="ef713781-2034-5fb4-83d1-e49d1d683694">4</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="VS" typeId="84309751-688d-50ef-8940-d8d042261a56">2</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Speed" typeId="25d0e01e-8e74-55b3-8a2a-17773c881625">11″</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Turn" typeId="899e9c58-70ef-5da5-8495-5bf6a8b7f8f0">90°</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Crew" typeId="2f6312dd-493e-53c6-96e2-d901afca0e81">3</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="916a9b7e-0783-5e62-a7e5-1ca415b72032" name="Mount Capacity" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Port: 1 | Starboard: 1 | Prow torpedo: 2 | Dorsal: 1 | Defence: 2</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="adfbe7ae-0ea3-5f5c-b7b5-6089ce429163" name="Hardpoint Construction" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Bare chassis only. Every weapon on a physical hardpoint is paid separately. There is no upgrade-spend ceiling: facing and mount count are the limits. v0.7 component prices are balanced around sustained fire, armour penetration, shield interaction, firing arc, reload and one-shot restrictions.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 </profiles>
 <rules><rule id="a3c3c302-f645-50e5-98e7-7663cf993904" name="Intervention" hidden="false"><description>Costs no order. When a friendly ship within 3″ is attacked, rammed, or targeted by torpedoes, this ship may thrust into the firing line from up to 10″ of the attacker: it does not move, and the whole attack resolves against it instead. Once per battle round.</description></rule><rule id="49117774-2b19-58be-825b-2c1587c3d82c" name="Gets Hot" hidden="false"><description>After a Lance Turret or Twin Lance Turret resolves its attacks, roll a D6. On a 1 the firing ship loses 1 Hull Point. Each mount rolls separately.</description></rule><rule id="cb0caff5-d4aa-59e0-8fd5-a5797b06a882" name="Line" hidden="false"><description>Counts as a Line Ship for every rule that names one, and toward the fleet's Line minimum.</description></rule><rule id="dbd5433a-4f2b-5195-8ee0-3924a509c071" name="Reload (X)" hidden="false"><description>After firing, place X Reload tokens on the mount; flip one at the end of each battle round. The mount cannot fire while it bears a token.</description></rule><rule id="151c8269-7a74-51e8-88f2-2665b7f08fb7" name="Devastating (X)" hidden="false"><description>Each hit costs X Hull Points, or 1 Void Shield Rating against live shields.</description></rule><rule id="061a6453-5b14-5b23-afda-1f10a8bcc9d3" name="Armourbane" hidden="false"><description>Roll 2D6 + Strength to penetrate instead of 1D6, at 6″ or less, against shields or hull alike.</description></rule><rule id="6dc485eb-70e6-5988-88b3-9ca4d8e90652" name="Point-Blank Broadsides" hidden="false"><description>At 6″ or less, Port, Starboard and Dorsal weapons improve AP by one step — or gain Armourbane instead if their printed AP is already 1. Prow weapons get neither.</description></rule><rule id="fa62eb3b-1bfd-518e-8acd-ff928e81e74d" name="Crippled" hidden="false"><description>Below half starting Hull Points: −1 BS and half Speed.</description></rule><rule id="756de160-4942-50ac-abcf-15fd4c57a7b7" name="Depleted" hidden="false"><description>At half starting Crew or less: −1 BS. Stacks with Crippled.</description></rule><rule id="cf754340-eaf8-5888-a648-135e74b4185b" name="Locked" hidden="false"><description>Joined by a ram. Neither ship may move; the rammer may not fire on its victim, who fires back at −1 BS. Break Away on 5+.</description></rule><rule id="8e15581f-4adb-57d8-8ad7-a7828eb8f176" name="Snap Shots" hidden="false"><description>Firing at BS 1 — hits only on a 6.</description></rule><rule id="081ae997-f695-51d1-b290-353a21ec7666" name="Wreck" hidden="false"><description>0 Hull Points without exploding. Becomes impassable, obscuring terrain; never moves and never Evades.</description></rule><rule id="6afa8d96-e9ef-5dac-8351-3979e9908ca5" name="Held station" hidden="false"><description>Moved 1″ or less under Burn Retros. Broadsides fire at +1 BS; −1 on Evade.</description></rule><rule id="561c4e9f-52fa-5f85-8254-1b1286a9845e" name="Screen" hidden="false"><description>A friendly Capital Ship within 3″ of one or more friendly Frigates is harder to pick out of the formation: enemy ships suffer −1 BS when targeting it. Screen protects only friendly Capital Ships, never the Frigate itself, and multiple Frigates do not stack — the modifier is never worse than −1.</description></rule><rule id="11cd4718-5518-5c13-860b-1a7a005a3a2a" name="Squadron" hidden="false"><description>Squadron: this vessel is taken singly, and up to 3 may be grouped into one squadron. A squadron moves and shoots as one unit and must keep coherency, each ship within 6″ of another in the squadron. It may split its fire, but every ship fires all of its own weapons at the one target it chooses.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks>
 <categoryLink id="3c333d6f-51b2-5306-afbd-089d0e482389" name="Line" hidden="false" targetId="96572996-e9b1-54a7-a2a9-2108e1dfc993" primary="true" />
 </categoryLinks>
 <selectionEntryGroups>
 <selectionEntryGroup name="Prow Mounts" id="d07bdf79-28c3-5b58-b9c6-69d3bb2b6599" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="4457b839-d163-5594-9f33-9d700181793c" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="0aa60608-d378-5229-a6be-804b1b049c36" name="Torpedo Tube" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="de7ae117-3e53-588f-8919-b08c39c0c26b" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="eefb6aa9-6369-56e8-8c70-77be29e2d52f" name="Torpedo Tube" hidden="false" typeId="9e230bf6-0ca5-5105-b10d-a29e26b36da4" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Mount" typeId="a7d4d3c1-fadb-52b5-b9c2-4ca7010a2a7f">Prow</characteristic><characteristic name="Str" typeId="909e3bc8-34f7-50eb-8079-4e717af82c39">9</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="1086c466-d9ef-5b28-afb0-8d806ff0f9c2">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Shots" typeId="f85124c6-e75b-574a-befd-08cd1968bedf">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Range" typeId="f06bbe8e-b4ee-55fe-a54c-c6fda727a7fd">60″</characteristic><characteristic name="Special" typeId="59853d0d-663c-56dc-9957-cd236b62b380">One torpedo per tube. Bypasses Void Shields; Armourbane within 6″; Reload (2)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="570b7f63-4fc7-515c-9c96-5b5c25501f85" value="10.0" /></costs></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup name="Port Mounts" id="7c984068-04b6-5e2d-b466-1ba342d41df4" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="2.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="5aadfa1e-ff86-5c48-aa3b-d2c6e0716893" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="d0779135-1eab-50ac-9eea-6b83332d288f" name="Macrobattery (Port)" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="2.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="86b18080-5be5-5fc8-b150-69f64a3c5530" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="872cb780-a576-5c5a-afba-2c9570dae1ef" name="Macrobattery (Port)" hidden="false" typeId="9e230bf6-0ca5-5105-b10d-a29e26b36da4" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Mount" typeId="a7d4d3c1-fadb-52b5-b9c2-4ca7010a2a7f">Port</characteristic><characteristic name="Str" typeId="909e3bc8-34f7-50eb-8079-4e717af82c39">8</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="1086c466-d9ef-5b28-afb0-8d806ff0f9c2">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Shots" typeId="f85124c6-e75b-574a-befd-08cd1968bedf">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Range" typeId="f06bbe8e-b4ee-55fe-a54c-c6fda727a7fd">30″</characteristic><characteristic name="Special" typeId="59853d0d-663c-56dc-9957-cd236b62b380">—</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="570b7f63-4fc7-515c-9c96-5b5c25501f85" value="10.0" /></costs></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup name="Starboard Mounts" id="59aeebeb-f53c-5ce0-8050-59a1ce1544e3" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="2.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="0b52591d-0d79-577b-af97-869f27ac9e01" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="8f394a81-79bf-5be6-9d72-2fb8747e986d" name="Macrobattery (Starboard)" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="2.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="453de979-3ace-5732-ad8a-bbc4c5eada62" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="e0bf95d9-ca04-52b5-ac64-60e0e8e61018" name="Macrobattery (Starboard)" hidden="false" typeId="9e230bf6-0ca5-5105-b10d-a29e26b36da4" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Mount" typeId="a7d4d3c1-fadb-52b5-b9c2-4ca7010a2a7f">Starboard</characteristic><characteristic name="Str" typeId="909e3bc8-34f7-50eb-8079-4e717af82c39">8</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="1086c466-d9ef-5b28-afb0-8d806ff0f9c2">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Shots" typeId="f85124c6-e75b-574a-befd-08cd1968bedf">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Range" typeId="f06bbe8e-b4ee-55fe-a54c-c6fda727a7fd">30″</characteristic><characteristic name="Special" typeId="59853d0d-663c-56dc-9957-cd236b62b380">—</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="570b7f63-4fc7-515c-9c96-5b5c25501f85" value="10.0" /></costs></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup name="Crew Upgrade" id="a2f39c25-88a6-5b0c-8ef1-8105b8af684c" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="0e34d185-0734-575f-9bc2-559c082d5956" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="9af65dc8-9c22-502c-8672-aa7c55c56951" name="Veteran Crew - Frigate" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="2b2b4302-9dd8-5a95-b04c-9f94dce7977c" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="4d46bb77-02f8-5058-8ca4-726a2c9d3dc4" name="Veteran Crew" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Once per ship. +1 BS, to maximum BS 5.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="570b7f63-4fc7-515c-9c96-5b5c25501f85" value="60.0" /></costs></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup name="Defence Mounts" id="3eb45495-c642-5c7f-b688-66ca4a60efb3" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true">
